# Binutils 2.47 IRIX series (issue #21): candidate, not yet selected.
#
# scripts/build-toolchain.sh still builds the 2.47 vanilla recipe. These
# patches are the re-derived IRIX fixes built and handed to the
# integrator for the controlled guest smoke; see docs/binutils.md for the
# prefixes, signatures and provenance. Once a candidate passes o32 and
# n32 on the guest, the selector's 2.47 recipe moves from `vanilla` to
# this series.
#
# Apply with `patch -p1` from the binutils-2.47 source root, in order.
# Provenance: SGUG-RSE binutils2_23.sgifixes.patch, onre/binutils-gdb
# binutils-2_44-irix (4b55be5884a3) and upstream commits 9e8082845f85,
# e6aea42dfa, a5499fa464, 9e6619e285 and 1f9b1a8435.
#
# Not carried; removed from the tree, kept in git history:
#   0002-irix-gp-global-absolute.patch: guest cand-b (0002 alone) failed
#     n32, and it did not fix o32.
#   0004-irix-compact-relocs.patch: guest cand-g still failed o32; the
#     working baseline's .compact_rel has num=0, so the reserved space is
#     inert to the loader.
0001-irix-got-local-restoration.patch
0003-irix-rld-map-section.patch
0005-irix-no-rld-map-rel.patch
0006-irix-crt1-section-alignment.patch
